# Status: RECOMMENDED, NOT YET TESTED (as of 2026-07-29)
# 122B total / 10B active MoE, has real thinking mode, scores higher on SWE-bench
# Verified (72.0) than qwen3-coder-next (70.6). Released Feb 2026 (Qwen's newest gen).
# Uses INT4 quant (~65-70GB estimated) -- do NOT use the FP8 release, that's ~122GB
# and will not leave enough headroom for KV cache on a 128GB machine.
#
# First switch to this profile will trigger a fresh download (~65-70GB) -- expect
# a long first boot. It has NOT been verified end-to-end:
# confirm tool calls work over /v1/chat/completions and check whether a
# --reasoning-parser flag is needed to get thinking content into the response
# cleanly (may be auto-detected by vLLM without any extra flag -- check the logs
# for a populated reasoning_parser value on first boot).
MODEL=Qwen/Qwen3.5-122B-A10B-GPTQ-Int4
MAX_MODEL_LEN=131072
GPU_MEMORY_UTILIZATION=0.85
EXTRA_ARGS="--enable-auto-tool-choice --tool-call-parser qwen3_coder"
